{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Little Chef: Cozy Cooking</i></strong>, each level is a self-contained puzzle sandbox where you play in one kitchen at a time. You\u2019ll unlock recipes by experimenting with ingredients, mastering hands-on cooking mechanics, and solving environment-based puzzles designed around the space itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.poster.avif?t=1757769155\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.webm?t=1757769155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and unlock different kinds of recipes, from comfort food and gourmet dishes to unusual surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying physics-based interactions with different ingredients and objects in the kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve playful puzzles to track down tricky ingredients, discover secrets, experiment and get creative in the kitchen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fun achievements that reward curiosity, chaos, and breaking the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a heartfelt story through unlocking each recipe, from childhood favourites to new creations.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMBINE INGREDIENTS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag, drop, toss, or gently place ingredients into pots, ovens and pans. Combining the right ones unlocks new recipes good and bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/d58c1ede755d8971e736d28ebeff6e8a.poster.avif?t=1757769155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/d58c1ede755d8971e736d28ebeff6e8a.webm?t=1757769155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY WITH PHYSICS\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything has weight and motion to it. Drag and drop items or throw them around. Explore, experiment, and see what secrets you can uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.poster.avif?t=1757769155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/3b85ca22a81af1858be3e2f48a529443.webm?t=1757769155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUZZLE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all ingredients are easy to find. Some are hidden, others are locked away, and solving these puzzles might mean thinking creatively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.poster.avif?t=1757769155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d6f795a04d78afebd5c5bbb69f96356.webm?t=1757769155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3376500?t=1757769155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/9a3b95eefc4a09f4582014c383ea776d463bbe21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757769155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/e085bd2323a07c881b34beeaec8b41ad7c7a0034/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757769155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/e085bd2323a07c881b34beeaec8b41ad7c7a0034/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757769155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3956680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Little Chef: Cozy Cooking</i></strong>, each level is a self-contained puzzle sandbox where you play in one kitchen at a time. You\u2019ll unlock recipes by experimenting with ingredients, mastering hands-on cooking mechanics, and solving environment-based puzzles designed around the space itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.poster.avif?t=1757769155\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/fa5b78fd19a7d7d92f7cb0f7ca909037.webm?t=1757769155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph